### ===================================================================
### Auth Service - Users & Authentication
### ===================================================================

### 1. Create a new user
POST http://{{AUTH_HOST}}:{{AUTH_PORT}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "StrongPass123!"
}

### 2. Create an admin user
POST http://{{AUTH_HOST}}:{{AUTH_PORT}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "AdminPass123!",
  "roles": ["Admin"]
}

### 3. Login (returns JWT in Set-Cookie header)
# @name login
POST http://{{AUTH_HOST}}:{{AUTH_PORT}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "StrongPass123!"
}

### 4. Login as admin
# @name loginAdmin
POST http://{{AUTH_HOST}}:{{AUTH_PORT}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "AdminPass123!"
}

### 5. Get current user (requires auth)
GET http://{{AUTH_HOST}}:{{AUTH_PORT}}/users
Cookie: Authentication={{AUTH_TOKEN}}
